About the project:
It is an applicant tracking and CRM system from the UK, for companies based in the cultural exchange sector.

We are looking for someone who is highly skilled in Ruby on Rails to join our team on a part-time basis (6-7 hours per day) to give more bandwidth to our existing team of developers.

Responsibilities:
— Development of new features;
— Extending existing functionality;
— Bug fixes and minor incremental changes.

Required skills:
— Ruby on Rails versions 5 and 6;
— MySQL;
— HTML & CSS (SCSS);
— Javascript;
— jQuery;
— Sidekiq;
— Redis;
— Memcached;
— RSpec and Capybara;
— React (is a plus).

Desired skills:
— AWS EC2, RDS, and Elasticache;
— Figma for prototyping;
— Previous travel experience;
— Comfortable meeting with clients virtually 2 time a week (Monday and Friday). 

Company values ​​are based on the fact that we hire people, not “resources”, which means:
— An absolute prohibition on forced overtime. Your family, hobby, dog, and so on will never be left without you because someone “asked” you to work longer;
— If overtime is present, of course at the request of a candidate and of course is paid;
— NO formal communication, we love jokes;
— An internally developed training system for employees to improve skills during working hours;
— A bonus system that involves additional payment for solving risky tasks or for additional responsibility on a project.

Hurry up and write to us. Looking forward to cooperating with you!

1xBet Partners is one of the world's largest gaming and betting affiliate networks.

About responsibilities:

- Attracting new webmasters and partners to your own CPA network;

- Onboarding and maintaining accounts of partners of the CPA network (affiliate marketing);

- Prompt response to requests from webmasters and solving their problems;

- Retention of partners and motivation to work with CPA;

- Increasing the turnover of partners, scaling, motivation;

- Analysis of partner and webmaster traffic in order to provide optimal solutions to improve the result;

- Participation in network development planning based on the requirements and feedback of partners;

- Participation in specialized events, including international ones, to establish partnerships;

- Good knowledge of English;

Requirements:

- Experience in CPA networks in betting, gaming;

- Knowledge of CPA market and affiliate marketing basics;

- Experience in promoting Internet projects and sales;

- Knowledge of English;

- Experience in traffic buying/arbitrage will be an advantage

We are ready to offer:

- Remote format of work;

- Flexible start of the working day;

- Fixed salary + KPI

We want to transform our Joomla site into WordPress, maintaining SEO and authority. This is fundamental for us so that we can make the transaction with the least impact and problems possible. We have a lot of relevant content on the site that would be indispensable to maintain, as well as the various languages.

We started this process but in the end, it became unsustainable for us to continue working on the project, so we have it unfinished. We're looking for someone who can follow it, improving design issues, responsibility and everything that makes sense to make our site more responsive and useful from the user's perspective... we're a recruitment site so the vacancy and application functionalities have to work excellently.

We still need to improve the conditions of the pages:
- Pay attention to SEO details: meta descriptions, URLs composition, the hierarchy of h's (h1, h2 ...), meta titles...
- Pay attention to the responsive and functional part, creating solutions with plugins and some HTML, CSS and javascript code language;
- Follow up with the missing contents, mainly translation to other web languages;
- To improve the design of the pages and make them visually more attractive according to the brand image, defining a pattern to follow in accordance with the web architecture;
- To improve the web architecture of the page from the user's perspective, highlighting the most relevant contents to the user and defining priorities;
